    "text": "\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dc4\u0dd2\u0dad \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0d9c \u0d87\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dba \u0dc4\u0dcf\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2 \u0dad \u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dad\u0daf \u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dc5 \u0dc0\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0d85\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dcf\u0d9f\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0d85\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0dc0\u0db8\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc1 \u0db4\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dc0\u0dbb \u0d9c\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0dca\u0dbd\u0d82\u0dc3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dad \u0dc0\u0dca\u0d9c\u0db1\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0d89\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0d82 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0da7\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dd4 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0dd0\u0dca\u0dda.",
    "fonts": [
      "Iskoola Pota",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      192.38,
      564.91,
      416.65,
      581.23
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR 25 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      201.77,
      586.27,
      407.41,
      598.75
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 24 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      608.62,
      550.25,
      676.15
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area over the Bay of Bengal in the vicinity of the North Andaman Islands is very likely to intensify into a depression by today (24). The system is expected to move west-northwestwards and intensify further into a deep depression by 25 October and into a cyclonic storm over the west-central Bay of Bengal by the morning of 26 October 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      679.33,
      550.44,
      732.34
    ],
    "text": "Although this system is not expected to have a direct impact on Sri Lanka, an increase in rainfall is expected over the southwestern parts of the island during the next few days, as the wind flow associated with the system extends across the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      735.49,
      551.15,
      787.66
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Northern and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts and, heavy falls about 100 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      790.45,
      550.71,
      829.78
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at several places after 1.00 p.m. in the Uva province and in Ampara and Batticaloa districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      833.2,
      550.48,
      887.4
    ],
    "text": "Fairly strong winds of about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, Northern, North-central and North-western provinces and in Trincomalee, Hambantota and Matale Districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      890.07,
      550.53,
      928.08
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
